# Test matrix

**Canonical template:** [`docs/test-matrix-template.md`](../docs/test-matrix-template.md)

## When to use

- **Planner:** Fill **Planned coverage** in `test-matrix.md` for non-trivial tasks; align layers with `plan.md` → **Validation commands** and AC IDs.
- **Test agent:** Implement Vitest specs; complete **Actual coverage** in `test-matrix.md` and `test-report.md` per [`.cursor/agents/test.md`](../agents/test.md).
- **Validator:** Cross-check `test-report.md` and `test-matrix.md` against `acceptance-criteria.md` (`TST-*` in [`docs/validation-checklist.md`](../docs/validation-checklist.md)).

## Runners (WFD)

- **Vitest** `server` project — unit / Node (`src/**/*.{test,spec}.ts`, not `*.svelte.test.ts`).
- **Vitest** `client` project — component / browser (`src/**/*.svelte.{test,spec}.ts`; Playwright as Vitest browser provider).
- **Standalone Playwright Test (`playwright test`)** — not adopted; do not require **E2E** layer until scripts and policy exist.

